# Architecture

- `app/` is Expo Router only (layouts, redirects, thin screens).
- Product code goes in `src/features/<name>/` with `components/`, `lib/`, `hooks/`.
- Reusable UI and helpers go in `src/shared/` (`ui`, `layout`, `forms`, `feedback`, `lib`, `hooks`).
- Do not recreate `src/components` or a flat `src/lib`.
- Import file paths: `@/src/features/money/lib/expense`, `@/src/shared/ui/SurfaceCard`.
- `usePalette()` at render; `createStyles = (colors) => StyleSheet.create(...)`. No theme colors in static stylesheets.
- Personal vs business: `isPersonalWorkspace`. Personal copy is Contact / Walk-in / Money.
- Never statically import `expo-notifications`.
- New features: follow `docs/adding-features.md`.
